13. How are you using AI in your daily coding activities?

1. I use approved AI coding assistants to understand unfamiliar code, generate boilerplate and get suggestions for implementation.
2. I use AI to identify possible bugs, understand exceptions, review code and suggest refactoring improvements.
3. I also use it to generate unit-test scenarios, edge cases and documentation.
4. I always review the generated code, validate business logic, run tests and check security before using it.

